BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All That Jazz
DTSTART:20250703T010000Z
DTEND:20250703T032500Z
DTSTAMP:20250703T010000Z
UID:vajHn3JlNb
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 123 mins (2h03m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Director/choreog
 rapher Bob Fosse tells his own life story as he details the sordid life of
  Joe Gideon (Roy Scheider)\, a womanizing\, drug-using dancer. Introduced 
 by SIFF Development & Membership Manager Carson Rennekamp.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/all-that-jazz
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Phoenician Scheme
DTSTART:20250703T231500Z
DTEND:20250704T012000Z
DTSTAMP:20250703T231500Z
UID:tF1E8vpB0H
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nThe story of a family and a fami
 ly business. Benicio del Toro plays tycoon Anatole "Zsa-zsa" Korda\, one o
 f the richest men in Europe\; Mia Threapleton is Sister Liesl\, his daught
 er/a nun\; Michael Cera is Bjorn Lund\, an entomologist.\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/cinema/in-theaters/phoenician-scheme
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:40 Acres
DTSTART:20250704T021500Z
DTEND:20250704T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20250704T021500Z
UID:46LKkjx1de
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nMusic video veteran R.T. Thorne 
 directs SAG nominee Danielle Deadwyler (The Piano Lesson) in this TIFF sen
 sation\, a speculative fiction thriller about a Black family in a starved\
 , post-civil war near future who must defend their farm from invading cann
 ibals.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/40-acres
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
